title>10 PRINT</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/10print/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2020 16:08:20 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/10print/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;BBC Micro take on &lt;a href="https://10print.org/"&gt;C64 10 Print&lt;/a&gt; one line random pattern generator.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="code-copy" type="button" hidden aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="code-copy-label" aria-hidden="true"&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;10 MODE 0&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;20 N=RND(1):IF N &amp;gt; 0.5 THEN PRINT &amp;#34;/&amp;#34;; ELSE PRINT &amp;#34;\&amp;#34;;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;30 GOTO 20&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;RUN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.co/xQag2GKwx0"&gt;Twitter Post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Golden Tail and Kitsune's Curse New Retro Game</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/goldentail/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2020 09:08:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/goldentail/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;New retro game, looks worth getting a Amstrad CPC emulator setup to play it.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;iframe id="lbry-iframe" width="560" height="315" src="https://lbry.tv/$/embed/amstrad-cpc-golden-tail-and-kitsune-s/95790dfec48b00467037e730b8c610716e5ccf52" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://lbry.tv/@retrorecollections:a"&gt;Video Source Retro Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&g